{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11411110","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11411110","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1141111001:1":{"text":"小的时候觉得这片沙漠无边无际，就是跑断腿也走不到尽头。","source_cn":"小的时候觉得这片沙漠无边无际，就是跑断腿也走不到尽头。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD03D4871D50B9842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1141111002:1":{"text":"那时候总是望着沙漠的尽头，盼着老爹回来。","source_cn":"那时候总是望着沙漠的尽头，盼着老爹回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x476325CCAC2A01AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1141111003:1":{"text":"嘿，因为老爹回来我们就有好吃的啦！","source_cn":"嘿，因为老爹回来我们就有好吃的啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E3BA168B55BF470","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141111004:1":{"text":"现在不一样啦，乌尔的孩子们开始等着我回来了。","source_cn":"现在不一样啦，乌尔的孩子们开始等着我回来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x642A5E300BF8A65D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"阿尔萨","source":"阿尔萨","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}